  {
   "id": "GTpJwveSAQAJ",
   "from": "Guido Biele",
   "author": "3f37be0cf708d442",
   "date": "2017-01-18T11:06:33Z",
   "subject": "Problem estimating covariance matrix in imputation model",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">Hello,</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">The model below\r\nimputes missing data from a multivariate <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">normal distribution\r\n(for some variable after applying a logit transform).<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">This works well in\r\nmost cases, but for some data some chains do not manage<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">to estimates the\r\ncovariance matrix and means of the mvn.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">At first I thought the\r\nproblem might be that I have highly correlated data that result <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">in a non-invertible\r\ncovariance martrix. While I indeed begin to observe <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">problems when the\r\ndeterminant of the cov matrix of the complete data drops from <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">0.14 to 0.07, the determinant never becomes smaller than 0.006 and some chains always<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">manage to estimate the\r\ncovariance matrix and means of the mvn. <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">So stan definitively\r\ncan estimate those parameters, just not consistently <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">with each chain with\r\nthe model below.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">It would be nice if\r\nanybody could look at the model code below and see if <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">I am doing something\r\nwrong.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Best - Guido<u></u><u></u></span></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">      </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># total N</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">      </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># number DVs</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">         </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># outcome seperately for DVs</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> upper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> logit_transf</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># 1 if logit transform is to be applied</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> missings</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> nmiss</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>transformed data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y_normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> missing_counter</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> missingL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> imp_idx_start</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> imp_idx_end</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    mc </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      missingL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  missings</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">?</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      mc </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> missingL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">?</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      missing_counter</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  missingL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">?</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mc </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      y_normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> missingL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">?</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">logit_transf</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">?</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> logit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>parameters </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  cholesky_factor_corr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> i_L_Omega</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// correlation matrix</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> i_mu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  real imps</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nmiss</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  row_vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y_normal_i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">//matrix[N,D] y_i;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  i_mu </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  i_L_Omega </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lkj_corr_cholesky</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  imps </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// no missing data</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nmiss</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        y_normal_i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y_normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// missings data</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">else</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// imputation on unbounded (normally distributed) scale</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        y_normal_i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> missingL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">?</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> imps</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">missing_counter</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y_normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// log posterior for imputations</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  y_normal_i </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> multi_normal_cholesky</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i_mu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> i_L_Omega</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br></span></div></code></div><div><br><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
